{
  "uid": "bready-overview",
  "title": "BReady 서비스 개요",
  "tags": ["bready"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "application",
        "label": "서비스",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": { "query": "label_values(http_server_requests_seconds_count, application)", "refId": "application" },
        "definition": "label_values(http_server_requests_seconds_count, application)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"] },
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "1. 입구 (Gateway)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 1 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "초당 요청 수",
      "description": "Gateway가 받은 전체 요청의 초당 개수",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 1, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=\"gateway-service\"}[$__rate_interval]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "decimals": 1, "noValue": "0", "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p95 지연",
      "description": "Gateway 요청 100개 중 95개가 이 시간 안에 끝난다",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 6, "y": 1, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{application=\"gateway-service\"}[$__rate_interval])))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "noValue": "-",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.3 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "4xx 비율",
      "description": "요청이 잘못됐거나 권한이 없어 거절된 비율. 401이 갑자기 늘면 토큰 문제를 의심한다",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 1, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=\"gateway-service\", outcome=\"CLIENT_ERROR\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=\"gateway-service\"}[$__rate_interval]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "-",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.3 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "5xx 비율",
      "description": "서버 쪽 실패 비율. 0이 아니면 바로 원인을 본다",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 18, "y": 1, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=\"gateway-service\", outcome=\"SERVER_ERROR\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=\"gateway-service\"}[$__rate_interval]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "-",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.01 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.05 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "결과별 초당 요청 수",
      "description": "성공·4xx·5xx로 나눈 요청 흐름. Gateway는 URL 패턴을 몰라서(uri=UNKNOWN) 결과로만 나눈다",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 5, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=\"gateway-service\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 20, "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" }, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "SUCCESS" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "CLIENT_ERROR" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "yellow" } }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "SERVER_ERROR" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }] }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "지연 p50 · p95 · p99 (점 = exemplar, 누르면 Zipkin)",
      "description": "p50은 보통 사용자, p99는 가장 운 나쁜 1%. 둘의 간격이 벌어지면 일부 요청만 막히고 있다는 뜻이다",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 5, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{application=\"gateway-service\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{application=\"gateway-service\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "exemplar": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{application=\"gateway-service\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "2. 서비스 / 엔드포인트",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 13, "w": 24, "h": 1 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "서비스별 p95 지연 (점 = exemplar)",
      "description": "Gateway의 p95가 오르면 여기서 어느 서비스가 원인인지 고른다",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 14, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (application, le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{application=~\"$application\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}}",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "서비스별 5xx 비율",
      "description": "5xx가 없는 서비스도 0으로 그려서, 선이 없는 것과 실패가 없는 것을 구분한다",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 14, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "(sum by (application) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=~\"$application\", outcome=\"SERVER_ERROR\"}[$__rate_interval])) or (sum by (application) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=~\"$application\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 0)) / sum by (application) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=~\"$application\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "느린 엔드포인트 Top 5 (p95, 점 = exemplar)",
      "description": "서비스 안에서 어느 URL이 느린지. 시점마다 Top 5가 바뀌면 범례에 5개보다 많이 보일 수 있다",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 22, "w": 12, "h": 9 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "topk(5, histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (application, method, uri, le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{application=~\"$application\", uri!=\"UNKNOWN\"}[$__rate_interval]))))",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}} {{method}} {{uri}}",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["max", "lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "실패가 많은 엔드포인트 Top 5 (5xx 초당 개수)",
      "description": "5xx를 낸 URL. 비어 있으면 서버 쪽 실패가 없다는 뜻이다",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 22, "w": 12, "h": 9 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "topk(5, sum by (application, method, uri, status) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=~\"$application\", outcome=\"SERVER_ERROR\", uri!=\"UNKNOWN\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}} {{method}} {{uri}} {{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["max", "lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "3. 다른 서비스 / 외부 API 호출",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 31, "w": 24, "h": 1 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "호출 대상별 p95 지연 (점 = exemplar)",
      "description": "내가 부른 쪽이 느린가. 모놀리식 → place-catalog, place-catalog → 카카오",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 32, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (application, client_name, le) (rate(http_client_requests_seconds_bucket{application=~\"$application\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}} → {{client_name}}",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "호출 대상별 응답 상태 (초당 개수)",
      "description": "부른 쪽이 무엇을 돌려줬나. 응답을 못 받으면(연결 실패·타임아웃) 상태 코드 대신 CLIENT_ERROR로 보인다",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 32, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (application, client_name, status) (rate(http_client_requests_seconds_count{application=~\"$application\", application!=\"gateway-service\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}} → {{client_name}} {{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "4. DB 커넥션 풀 (HikariCP)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 40, "w": 24, "h": 1 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "커넥션 사용 중 · 대기 · 최대",
      "description": "사용 중이 최대에 닿으면 다음 요청은 대기(pending)로 쌓인다",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 41, "w": 8, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (application) (hikaricp_connections_active{application=~\"$application\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}} 사용 중"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (application) (hikaricp_connections_pending{application=~\"$application\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}} 대기"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (application) (hikaricp_connections_max{application=~\"$application\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}} 최대"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": ".*최대" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "fill": "dash", "dash": [10, 10] } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": ".*대기" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "커넥션을 얻기까지 기다린 시간 (p95)",
      "description": "풀이 모자라면 여기가 먼저 오른다. 쿼리는 빠른데 요청이 느리면 이 값을 본다",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 8, "y": 41, "w": 8, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (application, le) (rate(hikaricp_connections_acquire_seconds_bucket{application=~\"$application\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "커넥션을 빌려 쓴 시간 (p95 · 최대)",
      "description": "트랜잭션이 커넥션을 쥐고 있던 시간. 트랜잭션 안에서 외부 API를 부르면 그 응답 시간만큼 길어진다",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 16, "y": 41, "w": 8, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (application, le) (rate(hikaricp_connections_usage_seconds_bucket{application=~\"$application\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}} p95"
        },
        {
